# Vendored byte-identical files must not be CRLF-converted on checkout.
# GITHUBIFY rule 21: when a shared tool is vendored here, pin it with
#   <path> text eol=lf
# Nothing is vendored at the moment (the two entries that used to sit
# here named files removed with the vendored conformance checker).

# Rule 30: every text file is LF in the index and on checkout, so a
# byte-compared artefact (the manual PDF is byte-reproducible) never
# differs by line endings between machines.
* text=auto eol=lf
